{"4381190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wrong Treatment", "steam_appid": 4381190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrong Treatment</strong> is a psychological horror survival game where the protagonist's mind becomes the main setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Federico Lopez, after a violent episode, is admitted to an isolated psychiatric hospital in Berdier, a tiny, forgotten town, far from everything. His treatment begins normally, but everything changes when beings that shouldn't exist appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't know if what you see is real, if it's a figment of your imagination, or if this godforsaken town has something to hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat against hostile enemies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal, tense close-quarters encounters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited resources</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find documents and clues that reveal information</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrong Treatment</strong> is a psychological horror survival game where the protagonist's mind becomes the main setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Federico Lopez, after a violent episode, is admitted to an isolated psychiatric hospital in Berdier, a tiny, forgotten town, far from everything. His treatment begins normally, but everything changes when beings that shouldn't exist appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't know if what you see is real, if it's a figment of your imagination, or if this godforsaken town has something to hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat against hostile enemies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p clas